      "en": "Lead the overflow into the furnace shaft: build a stone trough from the sea into the window above the left wall of the shaft."
    },
    {
      "zh-CN": "紧贴着海的右壁，往右画一条五格长的石线，一直伸进竖井左墙上方的窗口。",
      "en": "Right against the sea wall, draw a five-cell stone line to the right, reaching into the window above the left wall of the shaft."
